OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Archer returns to his
OL,4,Aformer school library
OL,5,
OL,6,FBestselling author Jeffrey Archer has
OL,7,Freturned to his former school ahead of
OL,8,Fthe publication of his final book.
OL,10,FArcher, who is 86 years old, sold more
OL,11,Fthan 300 million books in his
OL,12,Ffive-decade writing career, including
OL,13,Fthe Clifton Chronicles and Kane and
OL,14,FAbel, and has often set the novels in
OL,15,Fhis home town of Wellington, Somerset.
OL,17,FHis last book, Adam and Eve, is out
OL,18,Fsoon, and Archer took the opportunity
OL,19,Fto visit his former school library at
OL,20,FWellington School.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
