OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Archer returns to his
OL,4,Aformer school library
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's wonderful to come back. What I
OL,7,Fgot a real thrill about when I was
OL,8,Fwalking towards the library is seeing
OL,9,Fthe young boys and girls and thinking,
OL,10,F'that's the next generation'," Archer
OL,11,Fsaid.
